{"at":"2026-10-13T12:31:53.940Z","tool":"save_changes","args":"{\"issue\":10506,\"content\":\"Scope: the latest Chrome, Firefox and Safari on desktop; Safari on iOS for the mobile case. Read exact font sizes in the \\\"F\\\" field of the \\\"Properties\\\" panel (Alt+/, \\\"Shape properties\\\" section). On macOS use Cmd instead of Ctrl and Option instead of Alt. Presets: Small","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:31:56.884Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"The \\\"Font size\\\" control gets two presets after \\\"Very large\\\": \\\"Huge\\\" = 56 and \\\"Giant\\\" = 96, with tooltips \\\"Huge\\\" and \\\"Giant\\\" and no keyboard shortcuts; the existing four presets keep their labels and sizes, and the control has no typed size field.\",\"sourc","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:31:58.435Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"A text at exactly 56 or 96, however it got there, shows \\\"Huge\\\" or \\\"Giant\\\" highlighted; a size between presets or a selection with mixed sizes highlights no preset, and clicking a preset sets that exact size on every selected text.\",\"source\":\"PO answers on issue ","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:31:59.832Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"All six font size presets fit the 375 px mobile panel, and the Ctrl+Shift+> and Ctrl+Shift+< font size shortcuts have no upper limit.\",\"source\":\"PO answers on issue 10506, recorded and approved in the issue 10506 session, 2026-10-13\",\"issue\":10506}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:32:01.383Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"bound-text\",\"fact\":\"Text in shapes, arrow labels and sticky note labels offer the \\\"Huge\\\" and \\\"Giant\\\" presets: shape text wraps and the shape grows taller, arrow labels stay at the middle, and sticky notes keep auto-fit with the picked preset highlighted.\",\"source\":\"PO answers on issue 1","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:32:02.673Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"files-and-export\",\"fact\":\"Paste styles, copies and undo/redo carry the \\\"Huge\\\" and \\\"Giant\\\" sizes, and reload, a saved file, PNG and SVG export and live collaboration keep them.\",\"source\":\"PO answers on issue 10506, recorded and approved in the issue 10506 session, 2026-10-13\",\"issue\":105","outcome":"ok"}
